WEBVTT

00:11:28.058 --> 00:11:31.985
That isn't to say that I didn't have
my doubts along the way.

00:11:32.689 --> 00:11:36.350
When the plane bounced
on that landing strip in Cape Town,

00:11:36.374 --> 00:11:37.977
I remember thinking,

00:11:38.001 --> 00:11:42.207
"Why did I not just get myself
a therapist and a bottle of vodka

00:11:42.231 --> 00:11:44.447
like a normal person would do?"

00:11:44.471 --> 00:11:47.391
(Laughter)

00:11:47.415 --> 00:11:50.620
At times, our search
for understanding in Cape Town

00:11:50.644 --> 00:11:52.811
felt like an impossible quest,

00:11:52.835 --> 00:11:54.934
and all I wanted to do was to give up

00:11:54.958 --> 00:11:57.174
and go home to my loving
husband, Vidir,

00:11:57.198 --> 00:11:58.409
and our son.

00:11:59.994 --> 00:12:02.357
But despite our difficulties,